      "note": "PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, independent reconciliation. GMR wording and source Wylie remain verbatim; nothing is promoted to hgm_gloss. First rgyud refers to the stream in the no-affliction explanation and second rgyud to the stream in the no-suffering explanation. The first gcig/in question correspondence is uncertain; only the second gcig has an explicit one. The three with occurrences belong respectively to the first dang, the second stream-locative la, and the final dang. Both negative mixture compounds retain strictly tighter negative and positive members; together expresses mixing, not a supplied participant. Final phyir owns because of in the joint explanatory frame; zhing and the redistributed And remain unbanked. su/by is left unresolved within the taken-in construction, while ni has no separate English word exponent. The physical source preserves &apos;DRES BA&apos;I. Conventional PA spelling is counterbalanced by the exact HGM headword ma &apos;dres ba; spelling status remains unresolved and no erratum or source correction is filed."
